## Fenestration ratio (`ფანჯარა / ოთახი`)

- Daylight factor: **window area ≥ 1/8 of room floor area**
  (СНиП 23-05-95 + Neufert ch. 5).
- Bathroom: window optional if mechanical vent + duct ≥ 100 mm Ø.

