## Insolation (СНиП 2.07.01-89 §6)

- Each habitable room must receive ≥ **2.5 h** of direct sunlight on
  March 22 / September 22 in zones N of 50° (Tbilisi @ 41.7° gets ≥ 2 h).
- N-facing only: increase neighbour distance by 50 % or use offset.

