## How I use this rule

1. Check every generated room against the minimum (`§ Minimum room sizes`).
2. Check every door / window against the standard schedule (`§ Door / Window typical sizes`).
3. Check every flat against the per-type minimum area.
4. If anything fails — flag in the validation report with reference to the
   exact СНиП § / Neufert chapter / `N41` clause.
